&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;TIDE IS A PLACE FOR EVERYONE&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we believe that we can only succeed if we let our differences enrich our culture. Our Tideans come from a variety of backgrounds and experience levels. We consider everyone irrespective of their ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, family or parental status, national origin, veteran, neurodiversity or differently-abled status. We celebrate diversity in our workforce as a cornerstone of our success. Our commitment to a broad spectrum of ideas and backgrounds is what enables us to build products that resonate with our members’ diverse needs and lives.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are One Team and foster a transparent and inclusive environment, where everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Tide, we thrive on diversity, embracing various backgrounds and experiences. We welcome all individuals regardless of ethnicity, religion, sexual orientation, gender identity, or disability. Our inclusive culture is key to our success, helping us build products that meet our members&#39; diverse needs. We are One Team, committed to transparency and ensuring everyone’s voice is heard.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Disclaimer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;It has come to our attention that individuals or agencies are falsely claiming to represent Tide and are reaching out to candidates regarding job opportunities. Please be aware that:&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;not&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;charge any fees at any stage of the recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;All official Tide job opportunities are listed exclusively on our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.tide.co/careers/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Careers Page&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;and applications should be submitted through this channel.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Communication from Tide will only come from an official&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;@tide&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;.co&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;email address.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-style: italic;&quot; data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Tide does not work with agencies or recruiters without prior formal engagement, and we do not authorize third parties to make job offers on our behalf.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;If you are contacted by anyone misrepresenting Tide or requesting payment, please treat it as fraudulent and report it to us immediately at &lt;a ----- ----- safety and trust are important to us, and we are committed to ensuring a fair and transparent recruitment process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Tide leverages AI to enhance our hiring experience. You can read more about how we use AI in our recruitment process in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/5MFtWSdG8YLKq3jZkK52NY/3f18633073e6cdbd03bba4b9791c64f4/Using_AI_throughout_the_Hiring_Process.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;AI Policy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;Your personal data will be processed by Tide for recruitment purposes and in accordance with &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;c-link&quot; href=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/30JAUcDJMlaCwUKt4zoW0j/dd541981a67b6838d6e54537704bc8aa/Tide_Recruitment_Privacy_Notice_Job_Post_Version.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-stringify-link=&quot;https://assets.ctfassets.net/3h69mkdgxn20/1MYf6q4ZMWugpeaROVETBN/526e9c160a2de03576413c81657c6466/Recruitment_Privacy_Notice__Final_Draft__Sep_2024_.pdf&quot; data-sk=&quot;tooltip_parent&quot;&gt;Tide&#39;s Recruitment Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;Find Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Director, Accounting&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;London (UK) – Hybrid (2 days per week in office)&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With millions of diners, 60,000+ restaurant partners and 25+ years of experience, OpenTable, part of Booking Holdings, Inc. (NASDAQ: BKNG), is an industry leader with a passion for helping restaurants thrive. Our world-class technology empowers restaurants to focus on what matters most – their team, their guests, and their bottom line – while enabling diners to discover and book the perfect restaurant for every occasion.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every employee at OpenTable has a tangible impact on what we do and how we do it. You’ll also be part of a global team and its portfolio of metasearch brands. Hospitality is all about taking care of others, and it defines our culture.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A fast-paced, global business with significant growth ambitions, and an Accounting function entering a period of transformation to support that growth. This is an exciting opportunity to drive that agenda, with full ownership of the numbers and the scope to shape what comes next for the function.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting directly to the VP, Controllership and working in a leadership team alongside Reporting, Risk, and Payroll, the Director, Accounting holds full accountability for the completeness and accuracy of the Global General Ledger across the full P&amp;amp;L and Balance Sheet. This role will lead a team of accounting professionals and drive an improvement agenda that scales the function to meet the demands of a fast-paced business — through hands-on ownership of the numbers, critical thinking on every estimate and judgement, and continued development of the function beyond process compliance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own the Global General Ledger &amp;amp; Financial Close&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ultimate accountability for the Global GL under US GAAP, including the completeness, accuracy, and timely close of all entities worldwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and lead a scalable end-to-end close operating model; set standards, drive consistency, and coach the team to execute with rigour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain the quality of balance sheet reconciliations and close deliverables; identify and resolve issues in a timely manner, applying critical evaluation alongside sound accounting and commercial judgement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Estimates, accruals, and accounting positions that accurately reflect the pace and trajectory of the business, with the accounting telling the true story behind the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver authoritative monthly and quarterly P&amp;amp;L and balance sheet flux analysis — clear on commercial and accounting drivers, risks and opportunities, and material one-off items&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Apply and Uphold Technical Accounting Standards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The senior escalation point for accounting matters across the business; research, document, and defend positions on complex and novel issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide technical accounting support to business growth and commercial deals, including under ASC 606 (Revenue Recognition) and other judgement-intensive areas&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ground accounting in US GAAP principles and policies, with technical rigour as the baseline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate the accounting treatment of commercial arrangements with technical precision and commercial awareness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Critical thinking on every judgement call, with standard methodology as a starting point rather than a substitute for judgement&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive Continuous Improvement&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the improvement agenda — simplify, standardise, and automate close processes, leading with the adoption of AI and enabling technology&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner across Finance, Enterprise Systems and AI Enablement on systems transformation that scales the function for the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and embed quality standards, governance frameworks, and documentation requirements across a geographically dispersed team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Finance Operations and the Center of Excellence to maintain clear ownership and consistent execution across time zones (US West Coast, US East Coast, UK, India).&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead &amp;amp; Develop the Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coach and develop a team of accounting professionals, building technical capability and succession depth within the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create a high-performing team culture grounded in clear expectations, mutual accountability, meaningful development, and direct, honest communication&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Partner Across the Organisation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with Finance and Commercial business partners; bring commercial perspective to accounting judgements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp; Represent the Accounting function with confidence and credibility at senior management level&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fully-qualified accountant (ACA, ACCA, CPA, CA or equivalent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Significant post-qualification experience in financial accounting leadership, with full GL accountability and ownership of the end-to-end close cycle across a complex, multi-entity, global business — including the completeness and accuracy of the numbers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of leading and developing teams of qualified accountants and people managers&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Ways of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep technical grounding in US GAAP, with the confidence to take and defend positions on complex matters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Numbers-first with strong ownership of accuracy — credible at senior stakeholder level, telling the story behind the numbers and comfortable pushing back when warranted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A natural change leader with an improvement mindset — builds the case, brings the team along, and delivers lasting change at pace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high-performing people leader, invested in growth and outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At ease in fast-paced, global complexity, fluent across both strategic and detailed work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits and Perks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5 weeks paid vacation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Time off for your birthday&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from (almost) anywhere for up to 20 days per year&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on mental health and well-being:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid therapy sessions through SpringHealth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company-paid subscription to Headspace&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Annual company-wide week off a year - the whole team fully recharges (and returns without a pile-up of work!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid volunteer time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Focus on your career growth:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Development Dollars&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access to thousands of on-demand e-learnings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel Discounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Resource Groups&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private health &amp;amp; dental insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Income protection and life assurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program - including 24/7 GP &amp;amp; free legal advice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension plan contributions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted gym membership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike2Work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Season ticket loan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events &amp;amp; Thursday happy hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free lunch 2 days per week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Environment &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At OpenTable, we pride ourselves on fostering a global and dynamic work environment. As a team member with us, you will benefit from a schedule tailored to accommodate a global workforce operating across multiple time zones. While the majority of your responsibilities may align with conventional business hours, there will be instances where you are expected to manage communications - via calls, Slack messages, or emails - outside of regular working hours to effectively collaborate with international colleagues, respond to restaurant partners, and/or address urgent matters. OpenTable will always abide by and consider local laws and regulations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re committed to creating a workplace where everyone feels they belong and can thrive. We know the best ideas come when we bring different voices to the table, so we&#39;re building a team as dynamic as the diners and restaurants we serve—and fostering a culture where everyone feels welcome to be themselves.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need accommodations during the application or interview process, or on the job, we’re here to support you. Please reach out to your recruiter to request any accommodations.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;#LI-LT1 #LI-Hybrid&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;About THG&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;We are THG, a global ecommerce group on a mission to be the global online leader in beauty and sports nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Our portfolio of&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; leading retailers and brands such as LOOKFANTASTIC, Myprotein, ESPA, Perricone MD, and Cult Beauty form our two core businesses: THG Beauty and THG Nutrition.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;From Manchester to New York, we’re powered by a team of over 2500 people who work together, lead by example, and think BIG.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;With us, you’ll go further, faster. What are you waiting for?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role: National Account Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Area / Brand: Retail \ Myprotien&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Reporting to: B2B Sales Director&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location: THG ICON 1, 7-9 Sunbank Lane, WA15 0AF (Hybrid)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Life at THG Nutrition&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;353&quot; data-end=&quot;578&quot;&gt;THG Nutrition is home to some of the world’s most trusted and best-loved wellbeing and nutrition brands, including Myprotein, the world’s largest online sports nutrition brand, alongside Myvegan, Myvitamins and MP Activewear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;580&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Our brands and people exist to break boundaries — to power and empower those who want more. We move fast, challenge convention, and back ourselves to win. These values shape how we work every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;We are seeking an ambitious and commercially focused National Account Manager to drive growth across the Retail and Grocery channel. This role will be responsible for managing key national retail accounts, developing strategic customer partnerships, and delivering sustainable sales and profit growth across major grocery retailers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;The successful candidate will have strong FMCG experience, exceptional relationship management skills, and a proven ability to execute commercial plans within a fast-paced retail environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage and develop relationships with key Grocery and Retail customers across the UK market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver sales, margin, and distribution targets in line with annual business objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and execute Joint Business Plans (JBPs) to support long-term customer growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial negotiations including pricing, promotional activity, range reviews, and new product listings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to grow category performance, increase market share, and improve customer profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally with marketing, category, supply chain, finance, and demand planning teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse customer performance, market trends, and competitor activity to inform commercial strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage forecasting, promotional planning, and account performance reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with buyers, category managers, and senior retail stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the successful launch and distribution of new products across retail channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Skills &amp;amp; Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in National Account Management within FMCG or Consumer Goods.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing major Grocery or Retail accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial acumen with a track record of delivering growth targets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent negotiation and influencing skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and forecasting capability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build trusted customer relationships at multiple levels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organised with excellent project and time management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working within a fast-paced and commercially driven environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Preferred Experience&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing accounts such as Tesco, Sainsbury’s, Morrisons, Asda, Waitrose, Co-op, or Ocado.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of category management principles and retailer processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience within health &amp;amp; wellness, snacking, beverages, or high-growth FMCG brands.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with syndicated data platforms such as Nielsen or Circana.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What’s in it for me?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Career Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-leveltext=&quot;&quot; data-font=&quot;Symbol&quot; data-listid=&quot;18&quot; data-list-defn-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;335552541&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360,&amp;quot;469769226&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;Symbol&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469769242&amp;quot;:[8226],&amp;quot;469777803&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;left&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777804&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;&amp;quot;,&amp;quot;469777815&amp;quot;:&amp;quot;hybridMultilevel&amp;quot;}&quot; data-aria-posinset=&quot;1&quot; data-aria-level=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Access bespoke development programmes that have been designed and developed by our in-house L&amp;amp;D team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:720,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:279,&amp;quot;335559991&amp;quot;:360}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
