&lt;li&gt;50% off Food &amp;amp; Drink, 7 days a week&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Staff Room Rates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Health and Dental Care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
